@startuml 04-invitation-exchange
title Sequence 04 - Invitation issue and candidate access exchange
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor HR
actor Candidate
participant "Candidate browser" as B
participant "HTTP delivery" as H
participant "Access use case" as A
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Issue (HR, BR-CORE-031, 037) ==
HR -> H : POST /admin/interview-assignments/{id}/invitations\n(cookie, CSRF, empty body)
H -> A : IssueInvitation
A -> DB : insert or replace invitation (token hash only, 24 h)
H --> HR : 201 {id, assignmentId, expiresAt, token}
note right : token is returned once.\nHow the link reaches the candidate is outside\nthe documented flow.
HR ..> Candidate : invitation link

== Landing ==
Candidate -> B : open link
B -> H : GET /candidate/access
H --> B : landing HTML (no-store, no-referrer)
B -> B : history.replaceState removes token from URL
note right : GET or prefetch can never exchange

== Exchange (BR-CORE-032..034, 036) ==
B -> H : POST /candidate/access/exchange {token}
H -> A : Exchange
A -> DB : find invitation by hash, check expiry and revocation
alt valid
  A -> DB : insert candidate session (2 h absolute), COMMIT
  H --> B : 201 candidate, assignment, session + candidate cookie
else unavailable
  H --> B : 410 IA_INVITATION_UNAVAILABLE (no cookie)
end
note over A, DB : no interview execution is created

== Reuse session (BR-CORE-035) ==
B -> H : GET /candidate/session (candidate cookie)
H -> A : read session
H --> B : 200 candidate, assignment, session, csrfToken
B -> B : navigate once to /candidate/interview/page
note over B, H : reload reuses the session and never creates an execution
@enduml
